./.opencode/entities/identities/IDENTITY.SCRIPT.md:1:**Script** — a functional investigation layer. Ruby scripts in `_scripts/` with pure functional core in `_rb/` modules. Interpreted, no compilation step. Atomic ring audits (`r*-*.rb`) grouped by I/O severity. Read-only state analysis. Parallel execution via `r0-run-parallel.rb`.
./.opencode/entities/specifications/SPEC.CODE.RING.TOPOLOGY.md:1:**Code Ring Topology** — every script under `_scripts/` belongs to one of seven ordinal rings classified by I/O type. Inner rings are pure transformations; outer rings are operational I/O. Ring order governs dependency direction: verification follows ring order (innermost→outermost), execution follows reverse ring order (outermost→innermost).
